    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_2a44d3ca_label",
      "label": "Accordion.Header — Label",
      "default": "Is ThePhotoStick® Omni easy to use?"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_d3ca850e_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Yes, getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni is incredibly easy! Please note, however, that it will take some time for ThePhotoStick Omni to find each of your photos and safely back them up. This time can vary depending on how many photos you have, the size of your files, and the type of device you are using. But the great thing about ThePhotoStick Omni is that anyone can use it, no matter how comfortable they are with technology!<br><br>Check out our <a href=\"https://www.manula.com/manuals/product-support/thephotostick-omni-official-user-guide/\" target=\"_blank\">User Guide</a> for more information on getting started with ThePhotoStick® Omni. We also offer 24/7 support if you have any questions or difficulties: support@thephotostick.com"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_d1e9e9ad_label",
      "label": "Accordion.Header — Label",
      "default": "Which devices are compatible with ThePhotostick Omni?"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_e9ad11e3_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "ThePhotoStick® Omni works with all modern computers, smartphones, tablets, and computers right out of the box.<br><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">It's also compatible with all Windows, Android, and Mac Operating Systems:<br></span><br>- Windows: Windows 7 SP1 and later<br><br>- Apple: iOS and iPadOS 13.0 and later<br><br>- Android: 6.0 and later*<br> <sup>*ThePhotoStick® Omni is NOT compatible with Google Pixel smartphones.</sup><br><br>For more up to date information regarding ThePhotoStick compatibility, we recommend viewing our <a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/support-system-requirements\" target=\"_blank\">System Requirements</a> page.&nbsp;"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_590b6c66_label",
      "label": "Accordion.Header — Label",
      "default": "What photo and video file types can ThePhotoStick® Omni find and save?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_f2c253e4_label",
      "label": "Accordion.Header — Label",
      "default": "Can I use ThePhotoStick Omni as an ongoing backup solution?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_53e4f889_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Yes, it’s a great backup solution! Many people leave the ThePhotoStick Omni plugged in and do a weekly back-up to make sure they are continually protecting their memories."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_5e2fa92d_label",
      "label": "Accordion.Header — Label",
      "default": "Does ThePhotoStick® Omni need to install anything on my computer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_a92dc3a9_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">For computers (Mac or PC):<br><br></span>- ThePhotoStick® Omni does not need to install anything on your computer, nor does it require anything to be already installed on your computer.<br><br>- ThePhotoStick® Omni comes with everything it needs — you simply need to plug it into an available USB slot and it’s ready to run.<br><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">For smartphones and tablets (Android or iOS):<br><br></span>- ThePhotoStick® Omni offers a FREE app that allows you to back up, view, and organize your photos with ease.<br><br>- There are no monthly charges or download costs for using the app – just download it and click GO!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_fb6f986c_label",
      "label": "Accordion.Header — Label",
      "default": "How does the 30 Day Money Back Guarantee work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_986cc5f2_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "We offer a no-hassle, 30-Day Money Back Guarantee. If you’re not 100% satisfied with your purchase from ThePhotoStick®, we are happy to help you with a return. We want you to be happy!<br><br>If you are not completely satisfied with your order, please contact us at returns@thephotostick.com and we'd be happy to facilitate your return and refund."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_260055ab_label",
      "label": "Accordion.Header — Label",
      "default": "Will I have to pay any additional customs, duties or VAT fees when I receive my order?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_55ab2a51_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Depending on your country, it is possible that you will be charged one or more of these fees when you receive your order. \r\r"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_91e53761_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Let ThePhotoStick Omni's custom designed file-backup app do the work for you!\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_619d3f56_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Enjoy your free time with the ones you love most, and let ThePhotoStick Omni do the hard work for you.<br><br>You'll never have to waste hours of time trying to find, organize, and backup each of your photos and videos, again.\n\nThePhotoStick Omni can find, sort and organize your most treasured files. No lost hours. No missed photos. No Cloud fees."
    },
